    { "type": "textarea", "id": "step_3_body_2", "label": "Paragraph 2", "default": "The inside edge gets rounded and polished so it sits comfortably on the finger. The outside gets its final profile — clean and wearable. This is the stage where most of the time goes. There's no rushing a good ring." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Step 4" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "step_4_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Finished With Howard Feed-N-Wax" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "step_4_body_1", "label": "Paragraph 1", "default": "Every ring is hand-finished with Howard Feed-N-Wax Wood Polish & Conditioner — a natural, oil-based beeswax formula. No synthetic lacquers. No UV resins. No chemical coatings that will crack or peel over time." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "step_4_body_2", "label": "Paragraph 2", "default": "Unlike surface sealers, Feed-N-Wax penetrates deep into the maple grain and nourishes it from the inside out. The finish feels like wood, not plastic — and only gets better the longer you wear it." },
